wail|Loud sustained distress rather than ordinary quiet weeping is the boundary. Lost balloon is sufficient fictional cause; Vietnamese keeps child and balloon without introducing injury or hunger.
bizarre|Unusual display suits evaluative adjective without psychiatric judgment. Shoes and teapots translate faithfully; the definition does not equate uncommon with universally bizarre.
from|Place/source and start-time prepositions distinguished with complements. Parcel origin and staffed noon-to-close interval preserve direction and temporal bounds in Vietnamese; not a verb or infinitive marker.
last|Source-supported determiner, adverb, noun and duration verb reviewed separately. DETERMINER label remains an unresolved source classification; recent visit is not claimed final forever, and duration does not imply ending quality.
reform|Proposed system change noun and planned change verb separate. Admissions and complaints contexts preserve intention rather than asserting completed improvement; Vietnamese and object-clause valency checked.
